  "source_text": "Presidential Order of Botswana Home Europe Asia America Africa Oceania Links Back Tags list Allies Research Back Societies Forums Back All updates Album sheets Reference Catalogue Search Presidential Order of Botswana Order instituted in 1979. The insignia for the Presidential Order of Botswana shall consist of an eight-pointed Star worn on the left breast and a broad sash with sash badge worn over the right shoulder to the left hip. Recipient can add the letters P.O.B. after his name. Botswana Previous article: Presidential Order of Honour Prev Next article: Police Long Service & Good Conduct Medal Next ©\n    2007 -     2026\n    Ilja Repetski",
